# Computer Fundamentals (Basics)

## Motherboard: It holds all the different components in place and connects them.****

## CPU (Central Processing Unit): Execute instructions and process data

## RAM (Random Access Memory): RAM stores temporary data fore running programmes.

## SSD & HDD: Provide permanent storage.

## GPU (Graphic Card): Graphic Card renders images and video.

## The Network Adaptor: Network Adaptor connects a computer to a network 

## PSU (Power Supply): The PSU supplies power to all hardware components.

## Input and Output devices: Input devices send data to the computer, while output display results.

